WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.055 --> 00:00:06.761
Roxy looked at Terrell. "I have to stop that monster."

2
00:00:06.762 --> 00:00:12.057
"See you later," Terrell mumbled before walking away.

3
00:00:12.058 --> 00:00:14.833
"That's odd," Roxy thought.

4
00:00:14.834 --> 00:00:18.276
"Terrell seems annoyed. I wonder why."

5
00:00:18.277 --> 00:00:24.282
She sighed. "I can't think about that now."

6
00:00:24.283 --> 00:00:29.939
A moment later she was flying over the city.

7
00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:35.859
Roar! An enormous monster stood between several tall buildings.

8
00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:42.240
"Whoa!" Roxy said. "That monster is huge!"

9
00:00:42.241 --> 00:00:46.560
In the streets below, people ran in every direction.

10
00:00:46.561 --> 00:00:49.112
"Look out!" a taxi driver shouted.

11
00:00:49.113 --> 00:00:53.731
"Run for your lives!" a construction worker yelled.

12
00:00:53.732 --> 00:00:57.393
Crash! Two cars hit each other.

13
00:00:57.394 --> 00:01:00.561
Roxy flew down fast.

14
00:01:00.562 --> 00:01:03.757
"Is everyone okay?" she asked.

15
00:01:03.758 --> 00:01:06.043
One driver gave her a thumbs-up.

16
00:01:06.044 --> 00:01:10.969
"I'm fine!" she said. "This car was old anyway."

17
00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:13.074
The other driver frowned.

18
00:01:13.075 --> 00:01:17.259
"Ugh! I spilled a mango smoothie all over myself!"

19
00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:22.054
He sighed. "But I'm okay."

20
00:01:22.055 --> 00:01:25.656
"Rocket Girl!" Detective Smith shouted.

21
00:01:25.657 --> 00:01:29.432
Roxy saw the detective hiding behind a hot dog stand.

22
00:01:29.433 --> 00:01:31.820
She flew over to him.

23
00:01:31.821 --> 00:01:34.284
"Hi, Detective!" Roxy said.

24
00:01:34.285 --> 00:01:37.830
"I didn't know you worked at a hot dog stand."

25
00:01:37.831 --> 00:01:43.497
The detective frowned. "Very funny, Rocket Girl."

26
00:01:43.498 --> 00:01:47.554
"Do you know where the monster came from?" Roxy asked.

27
00:01:47.555 --> 00:01:51.272
"I have no idea," Detective Smith said.

28
00:01:51.273 --> 00:01:55.017
The hot dog stand owner popped up from behind the stand.

29
00:01:55.018 --> 00:01:57.957
"It just appeared suddenly!"

30
00:01:57.958 --> 00:02:00.402
"Huh?" Roxy said.

31
00:02:00.403 --> 00:02:03.730
"Everything was fine," the owner said.

32
00:02:03.731 --> 00:02:06.911
"Until I looked down to get a hot dog for a customer.

33
00:02:06.912 --> 00:02:12.683
When I looked back up, that monster was here!"

34
00:02:12.684 --> 00:02:20.459
Roar! The monster walked down the street as cars and buses swerved to avoid being hit.

35
00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:26.670
"Wait here, Detective!" Roxy flew after the enormous monster.

36
00:02:26.671 --> 00:02:30.177
"Hey! Stop right there!"

37
00:02:30.178 --> 00:02:32.441
The monster didn't seem to hear her.

38
00:02:32.442 --> 00:02:35.075
It kept walking slowly.

39
00:02:35.076 --> 00:02:38.975
Roxy got ready to fire her eye laser beams.

40
00:02:38.976 --> 00:02:45.775
But then a bus turned too fast and flipped over.

41
00:02:45.776 --> 00:02:52.952
Roxy shot back down to the street and lifted the bus back onto its wheels.

42
00:02:52.953 --> 00:03:00.129
"Thanks, Rocket Girl!" The bus driver slammed on the gas pedal and sped away.

43
00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:04.986
Roxy flew back up and saw the enormous monster swatting at helicopters.

44
00:03:04.987 --> 00:03:08.717
One helicopter swerved, and its tail bumped a building.

45
00:03:08.718 --> 00:03:13.793
The tail broke, smoke poured out, and the helicopter began to spiral down.

46
00:03:13.794 --> 00:03:19.457
"Yikes!" Roxy shot through the air and grabbed the helicopter with both hands.

47
00:03:19.458 --> 00:03:25.259
"Grr!" Roxy struggled to slow the helicopter down.

48
00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:29.927
Finally she brought it down safely in Metro City Park.

49
00:03:29.928 --> 00:03:34.509
The pilot wiped sweat from his forehead. "Thanks, Rocket Girl!"

50
00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:38.311
Roxy smiled. "No problem."

51
00:03:38.312 --> 00:03:41.206
She quickly flew back downtown.

52
00:03:41.207 --> 00:03:45.093
The monster headed down a wide street.

53
00:03:45.094 --> 00:03:48.622
As Roxy followed it, she noticed something odd.

54
00:03:48.623 --> 00:03:52.380
"That monster is moving silently," she thought.

55
00:03:52.381 --> 00:03:56.976
"I don't hear any stomping." Then she gasped.

56
00:03:56.977 --> 00:04:00.582
The monster's paw seemed to go right through a building.

57
00:04:00.583 --> 00:04:03.070
But the building looked fine.

58
00:04:03.071 --> 00:04:08.375
Roxy scratched her head. "Is the monster a hologram?"

59
00:04:08.376 --> 00:04:13.615
The monster was now walking toward the mountains outside the city.

60
00:04:13.616 --> 00:04:17.344
She followed it out of the city.

61
00:04:17.345 --> 00:04:20.796
Blink! It disappeared.

62
00:04:20.797 --> 00:04:25.252
Confused, Roxy looked all around.

63
00:04:25.253 --> 00:04:29.252
Then she saw a familiar alien superhero nearby.

64
00:04:29.253 --> 00:04:32.388
"Kid Comet!" Roxy shouted.

65
00:04:32.389 --> 00:04:38.875
Cozlin grinned. "Hey, Rocket Girl!"

